Group name tag=Skid Steering
Draw title screen=true
Wheel friction - Driving (%)=50
Wheel friction - Turning (%)=50
Friction ramp-up time - Turning to Driving (s)=2
Friction ramp-up time - Driving to Turning (s)=0
Gyro power - Driving (%)=10
Gyro power - Turning (%)=100
